Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Reconcile code, documentation, support guidance, and customer notices into one release state. Explain audience-specific consequences and verify that approved migrations and communications match the exact release artifact being promoted.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
